      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29128f587491bba9e55a0fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Go go☆Rickey！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f39589463ec38d543394b17855fa9ac130b410ea5887183a36b2d56f0b83a8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2aaaf314c4510be021296a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "八卦，替我指引道路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2000c3ff2fd504a28986c9ae9986ee0b19e3e37f8edaae82e9134a4fb265b3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6377869286fb147aabf04387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然风水不是魔法，\n但只要心心相连就能带来幸福！\n来把这份连结推广开吧，你也一起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1b0bfdf029d066f73570d29b7fefa047f4f17b53d81b8ab241e4c4f23792ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9d67d1311d679ee5dc20b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海水浴能让全身直接沐浴海的“气”！\n但要是太过赤裸地承接，\n气也是会发生紊乱的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d6045f19a88e08da6db2786ba2dde2864f7ff2923d42c7971422fabb855e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843945fe23f9afdf9bf4d80e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那张照片上传到Umasta后\n立刻引起了大反响~！\nRickey☆爆火~☆大・成・功！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f1da36ebbcda051c3abaa94f7724f96407deb85536e1690f957ec808509676f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126f186f719137720b2554ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心光即阳气！\n所以人与人之间的联系，\n是能不断扩大的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b826b885ced7e06a700c00ca71eec662200f752388a8caadc60b61b1d2f7c922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:543e4dba5225b33bac4d74d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运势已经调整好了──\r\n消灾解厄，手握幸运！\r\n万事向吉，开运完毕☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2fbb08b55437458d07186a92c25e4916368a04ee00b8a482d2065f15da87faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edef1d21b060a5ff0981f140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你和我都是大吉祥♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b7f528c4fbf494a6d8a40cba306ffd6d284e1f3a943030b2acac417c4720d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f034c6015dbf22cce7b3965b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸运的旋律从心中满溢而出呢！\n闪耀的街道……大家的笑容！\n你和我都是大吉祥♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c381df52f483d1ecb9d825008dc27498a344bad3d85c9bbe598e75d5da9e24f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
